PML output uses Calibre's PMLZ writer.

Calibre 9.15 has no .pml output plugin, so every conversion targeting PML failed even though Filee advertised it.
Keep the existing `pml` target and PML input support, but invoke Calibre with and allocate a .pmlz output. The archive
contains index.pml and index_img/, so images are preserved. Includes a real-Calibre regression test that opens the
result and checks its contents.

Drop it when upstream ships an equivalent.

diff --git a/src/Filee.Engines/Ebooks/CalibreConverter.cs b/src/Filee.Engines/Ebooks/CalibreConverter.cs
